---
import { skillsExplorer as app } from '../data/skillsExplorer';
---
<section class="skills-explorer-overview" aria-labelledby="skills-explorer-title">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Terminal workbench · v{app.version} · MIT</p>
    <h2 id="skills-explorer-title">Your installed skills, in one place.</h2>
    <p><strong>Skills Explorer</strong> brings your agent skills into a searchable terminal interface.
      Read files and references, edit with backups, inspect usage and context size,
      and launch your optimization and evaluation tools from one command menu.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse Claude, Codex and other skill roots together.</li>
      <li>Navigate with arrow keys, search commands, and press <kbd>?</kbd> for help.</li>
      <li>Open a cached inventory quickly; refresh as files change.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/downloads/#skills-explorer">Get Skills Explorer</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href={app.release}>GitHub release &amp; source</a>
    </p>
    <p class="install"><code>brew install mithudso/tap/skills-explorer</code></p>
    <p class="note">Homebrew, npm package or Python source · runs locally in your terminal</p>
  </div>
  <figure>
    <a href="/downloads/#skills-explorer-screenshots" aria-label="See Skills Explorer screenshots and usage">
      <img src="/images/skills-explorer/workbench.svg" width="1482" height="1026"
        alt="Skills Explorer terminal with a skill tree, Edit, Optimize and GitHub menus, command search and a colored Markdown reader."
        loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </a>
    <figcaption>Skills Explorer with a small example skill library.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<style>
  .skills-explorer-overview { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; align-items: center; gap: var(--sp-6); margin: var(--sp-7) 0; padding: var(--sp-6); background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); }
  .skills-explorer-overview > * { min-width: 0; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h2 { margin-top: var(--sp-2); }
  ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  li { margin-bottom: var(--sp-2); }
  figure { margin: 0; }
  img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: var(--radius); background: #0c1021; }
  figcaption, .note { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--ink-muted); }
  figcaption { margin-top: var(--sp-2); }
  .install { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  kbd { font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .skills-explorer-overview { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .skills-explorer-overview { padding: var(--sp-4); } }
</style>
